DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T103000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! Brookdale Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nIf entering from Bellevue Avenue and park in the
  first parking lot on the left. We will be gathering near the playground a
 rea.\n\nif entering from Watchung Ave\, park and walk up to the upper park
 ing lot near the playground area.\n\nWe will be walking the outer path. Th
 ere are several break-off points if you do not want to walk the entire pat
 h.\n\nThe walk will be about an hour or at least 3-4 miles.\n\nWear comfor
 table shoes!\n\nPlease plan to arrive 5 minutes early. The walk will start
  promptly.\n\nBrookdale Park offers the public access to both passive and 
 active recreational activities as well as picturesque vistas. Trails for w
 alking and running\, lush groves and extensive lawns\, playgrounds\, sport
 s fields\, track facilities\, tennis courts\, an archery range and stadium
  grandstand are just some of the numerous attractions that make Brookdale 
 Park a magnet for nature lovers\, families\, and physical fitness enthusia
 sts for miles around.\n\nhttps://www.essexcountyparks.org/parks/brookdale-
 park\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for a hike\, please understand that you
  are responsible for your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no
  one else liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/317143839/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261026T121701Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261026T121701Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_317177534@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052246Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T110000
SUMMARY:🥾 Let's Hike!! at Garret Mountain 
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\n“Let’s Walk” turns **13 years** old this N
 ovember! Join us for a small celebration in the parking lot after today’
 s hike.\n\nGarret Mountain Yellow and White Loop Trail is a heavily traffi
 cked loop trail located near Woodland Park\, New Jersey that features a la
 ke and is good for all skill levels. The trail offers a number of activity
  options and is best used from March until October.\n\n**PLEASE ARRIVE 5 M
 INUTES EARLY SO WE CAN START ON TIME!**\n\nWe will hike a moderate 3 miles
 . This is **not** a paved trail\, please do **not** wear sneakers.\n\nWe w
 ill meet in the **Auto Overlook** parking lot. It’s a one way\, you will
  pass the equestrian\, Lambert Tower before reaching the sign for AUTO OVE
 RLOOK.\n\nAs always\, we will go at a moderate pace and won’t leave anyo
 ne behind. But **please be considerate** of others if you don't think you 
 will be able to hike at a moderate pace for the duration.\n\n[https://www.
 google.com/maps/place/Parking+lot\,+Paterson\,+NJ+07503/@40.9057189\,-74.1
 750062\,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c2fdd38a2aa1a1:0x526711cb124756e2!
 8m2!3d40.905813!4d-74.1750982!16s%2Fg%2F11fx7w406f?hl=en-US&entry=ttu](htt
 ps://www.google.com/maps/place/Parking+lot\,+Paterson\,+NJ+07503/@40.90571
 89\,-74.1750062\,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c2fdd38a2aa1a1:0x526711cb
 124756e2!8m2!3d40.905813!4d-74.1750982!16s%2Fg%2F11fx7w406f?hl=en-US&entry
 =ttu)\n\nRain or extreme weather will cancel the event.\n\nDisclaimer: If 
 you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for yo
 ur own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in cas
 e of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/317177534/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261028T172605Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T172605Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
