DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T110000
SUMMARY:Verona Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK\n\nWe will meet at the benche
 s in front of the boathouse.\n\nWe will walk the loop around the park. The
  goal will be at least three miles\, but there is plenty of opportunity to
  stop or continue to fit your personal goals.\n\nWe will be walking on a *
 *paved surface.**\n\nWe walk at a **medium speed**. As always\, we will go
  at a moderate pace and won’t leave anyone behind. But **please be consi
 derate** of others if you don't think you will be able to walk at a modera
 te pace for the duration.\n\nPlease plan to arrive 5 minutes **early** so 
 that we can **start on time.**\n\nVerona Park is 54.32 acres with a lake r
 unning through it. It is bordered by Lakeside and Bloomfield Avenues in th
 e southern part of Verona. It is the fifth largest park in the Essex Count
 y system\, making it a great place to walk.\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us 
 for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prepa
 redness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury 
 or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/317178081/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261028T173404Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T173404Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
